WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:02.720
Qing Province

00:02.800 --> 00:03.440
Surely has traitors

00:03.520 --> 00:04.480
Intentionally causing trouble

00:04.560 --> 00:05.440
Disrupting state policy

00:05.520 --> 00:06.920
Inciting rebellion

00:07.320 --> 00:08.720
Elder brother

00:08.840 --> 00:10.507
Was also harmed by traitors

00:11.000 --> 00:12.667
Your son will thoroughly investigate

00:12.800 --> 00:13.880
Catch the traitors

00:13.960 --> 00:16.160
And have the Imperial City Guard convict them

00:16.240 --> 00:17.040
This matter

00:17.120 --> 00:18.520
Can be resolved

00:21.760 --> 00:22.960
Good

00:23.040 --> 00:24.360
Very good
